<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 19:46:36 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>“如果输入的不是新闻怎么办？如果输入的是你怎么办？ Bill Gross 免费赠送 120 万个人工智能商业创意——财富 500 强是下一个</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/17/bill-gross-idealab-ai-patents-fortune-500-license-caltech/</link><description>Idealab.ai 的创始人表示，他的系统在加州理工学院的专利中发现了 3,867 项业务。现在他正在向公司研发部门推销它。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/bill-gross-idealab-fortune-500-innovation-forum-2026.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 17:44:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/17/bill-gross-idealab-ai-patents-fortune-500-license-caltech/</guid></item><item><title>商会高级官员表示，中期选举不仅仅涉及价格：大约 20 年增长率为 2%</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/16/us-chamber-neil-bradley-midterms-growth-easy-button-price-controls/</link><description>尼尔·布拉德利警告华盛顿不要使用利率上限和价格控制的“简单按钮”。他的增长数学是成立的；他的修复是另一回事。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/neil-bradley-us-chamber-fortune-500-innovation-forum.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 21:32:41 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/16/us-chamber-neil-bradley-midterms-growth-easy-button-price-controls/</guid></item><item><title>小时工的通货膨胀率为 7.86%。难怪他们投票反对人工智能热潮</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/18/hourly-workers-inflation-data-center-backlash-workwhile-simon-khalaf/</link><description>反弹和扩建是一个问题。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2303379781.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 19:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/18/hourly-workers-inflation-data-center-backlash-workwhile-simon-khalaf/</guid></item><item><title>狄龙·布鲁克斯？在卡尔希？天哪，勒布朗·詹姆斯起诉了体育博彩应用程序，该应用程序的人工智能版本的他说了这句话</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/18/kalshi-lebron-james-sports-betting-ai-lawsuit/</link><description>一款名为 Bron（不要与勒布朗·詹姆斯混淆）的体育博彩应用程序收到了这位 NBA 球星的诉讼。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2252894366-e1795027406972.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 19:26:23 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/18/kalshi-lebron-james-sports-betting-ai-lawsuit/</guid></item><item><title>克里斯·克里斯蒂表示黄仁勋不应该回到英伟达。几个小时后，董事会同意了</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/18/chris-christie-says-jensen-huang-shouldnt-come-back-to-nvidia-hours-later-the-board-agreed/</link><description>克里斯蒂和拉姆·伊曼纽尔都在考虑 2028 年白宫竞选，但他们在英伟达是否需要黄仁勋回归的问题上存在分歧。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/55659122498_53c47774bb_o-e1795026598194.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 19:11:02 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/18/chris-christie-says-jensen-huang-shouldnt-come-back-to-nvidia-hours-later-the-board-agreed/</guid></item><item><title>人工智能泡沫正在破裂。华尔街很紧张</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/18/ai-bubble-financing-nvidia-coreweave-circular-deals-credit-mark-minevich/</link><description>我们所知道的人工智能淘金热已经结束。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2300814844-e1794412283810.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 19:10:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/18/ai-bubble-financing-nvidia-coreweave-circular-deals-credit-mark-minevich/</guid></item><item><title>JD Vance 表示美国人不需要囤货。五角大楼和美国盟友正在为最坏的情况做准备</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/18/jd-vance-stock-up-supplies-outages-allies-prepare-pentagon/</link><description>德国建议供应 10 天，日本建议至少供应 3 天。卡内基梅隆大学的一位风险专家表示，华盛顿的保证取决于公众对它的信任。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2304637477.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 19:06:06 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/18/jd-vance-stock-up-supplies-outages-allies-prepare-pentagon/</guid></item><item><title>《侠盗猎车手 VI》背后的首席执行官并不玩电子游戏，但分析师称他已投入 15 亿美元来支持十年来最大规模的游戏发布</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/grand-theft-auto-6-gta-strauss-zelnick-ceo-video-games-tech-take-two-interactive/</link><description>Take-Two Interactive Software 首席执行官斯特劳斯·泽尔尼克 (Strauss Zelnick) 表示：“我认为，担任首席消费者并不能真正帮助首席执行官在这项业务中发挥有效作用。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/GettyImages-2271063174-e1778080812190.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 19:01:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/grand-theft-auto-6-gta-strauss-zelnick-ceo-video-games-tech-take-two-interactive/</guid></item><item><title>俄克拉荷马州州长认为大学“陷入困境”。他的解决方案——三年制学士学位——已经迅速传播开来</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/18/oklahoma-governor-stitt-three-year-college-degree-fortune-500-innovation-forum/</link><description>“学术界有点固守自己的方式，”俄克拉荷马州州长凯文·斯蒂特告诉《财富》杂志。 “他们不喜欢改变。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/kevin-stitt-fortune-500-innovation-forum-2026.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 18:48:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/18/oklahoma-governor-stitt-three-year-college-degree-fortune-500-innovation-forum/</guid></item><item><title>家得宝即将上任的首席执行官表示，房主“感受到了压力”。四分之一的钱不足以支付 5,000 美元的维修费用</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/18/home-depot-ceo-richard-mcphail-homeowners-financial-pressure-repairs/</link><description>三分之一的房主推迟了维修工作，许多人现在正在自己做这项工作。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18046-ted_decker_richard_mcphail-e1795024576862.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 18:04:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/18/home-depot-ceo-richard-mcphail-homeowners-financial-pressure-repairs/</guid></item></channel></rss>